WEBVTT

00:09.034 --> 00:10.310
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.379 --> 00:12.000
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:12.068 --> 00:13.482
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:13.551 --> 00:15.448
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:15.517 --> 00:18.482
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:18.551 --> 00:20.586
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:20.655 --> 00:22.586
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:22.655 --> 00:24.482
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:24.551 --> 00:26.172
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:26.241 --> 00:28.620
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:28.689 --> 00:30.586
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:30.655 --> 00:32.551
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:32.620 --> 00:34.586
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:34.655 --> 00:36.448
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:36.517 --> 00:38.586
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:38.655 --> 00:40.689
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:40.758 --> 00:42.034
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:42.103 --> 00:43.896
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:43.965 --> 00:46.620
[laughing]
[笑]

00:46.689 --> 00:48.931
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:49.000 --> 00:51.689
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:52.068 --> 00:54.000
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

00:54.068 --> 01:01.344
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:02.310 --> 01:05.689
- [cackling]
- [咯咯笑]

01:05.758 --> 01:09.758
Yes!
My plan is working.
是的！
我的计划正在发挥作用。

01:09.827 --> 01:13.586
Now everyone in town will know
what a jerk Krabs is.
现在城里的每个人都会知道
螃蟹真是个混蛋。

01:13.655 --> 01:14.896
Yeah!
是的！

01:15.275 --> 01:18.689
[indistinct chattering]
[模糊不清的喋喋不休]

01:20.586 --> 01:22.206
Huh?
- Hey, you!
啊？
- 嘿，你！

01:22.275 --> 01:24.275
You're under arrest.
你被捕了。

01:24.344 --> 01:26.413
- Arrest?
For what?
- 逮捕？
为了什么？

01:26.482 --> 01:28.827
I didn't even steal anything
this time.
我什至没有偷任何东西
这次。

01:28.896 --> 01:30.965
- Vandalism's a crime too.
- 破坏公物也是犯罪行为。

01:31.034 --> 01:33.724
You've been caught red-handed,
Plankton.
你被当场抓获了
浮游生物。

01:33.793 --> 01:35.586
- Eh, should've used
the green paint.
- 呃，应该用过
绿色油漆。

01:35.655 --> 01:38.724
- I usually laugh all
the way to the bank.
- 我通常都会笑
去银行的路。

01:38.793 --> 01:40.551
But for you Plankton,
但对你来说，浮游生物，

01:40.620 --> 01:43.137
I'll laugh all the way
to the clink!
我会一路笑
叮当声！

01:43.206 --> 01:46.413
[cackling]
[咯咯笑]

01:47.241 --> 01:49.310
[cackling continues]
[咯咯笑声继续]

01:49.379 --> 01:52.000
- Oh no, the prison is full!
- 哦不，监狱已经满了！

01:52.827 --> 01:55.206
Looks like we'll just
have to set you free.
看来我们只需
必须让你自由。

01:55.275 --> 01:58.413
- What, free?
But he's a criminal.
- 什么，免费？
但他是一个罪犯。

01:58.482 --> 02:00.241
- Well, you know what they say.
- 嗯，你知道他们说什么。

02:00.310 --> 02:03.448
Don't stop the crime
if you can't enforce the time.
不要停止犯罪
如果你不能强制执行时间。

02:03.517 --> 02:07.172
- Eat it, Krabs!
I'm off to re-offend.
- 吃吧，螃蟹！
我又要再犯了

02:08.000 --> 02:10.965
- It's a shame that there's
no other place in Bikini Bottom
- 很遗憾有
比基尼泳裤中没有其他地方

02:11.034 --> 02:12.827
to hold our extra criminals.
关押我们额外的罪犯。

02:12.896 --> 02:15.896
'Cause we'd give that place
a lot of money.
因为我们会给那个地方
很多钱。

02:15.965 --> 02:17.482
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

02:17.551 --> 02:19.793
You got yourself a deal.
你自己达成了协议。

02:21.517 --> 02:25.551
We can lock him up at
my place, The Krusty Krab.
我们可以把他锁在
我的家，蟹堡王。

02:25.620 --> 02:27.793
- Well then, this is
for the prisoner.
——那么，这就是
对于囚犯。

02:27.862 --> 02:29.551
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

02:29.620 --> 02:32.413
- And here's your cash.
- 这是你的现金。

02:33.344 --> 02:37.000
- Whoa.
[giggling]
- 哇哦。
[咯咯笑]

02:37.068 --> 02:39.586
Thank you, Madame Officer.
谢谢您，警官女士。

02:40.965 --> 02:43.000
- [wailing]
- [哀号]

02:43.068 --> 02:46.965
- Oh, stupid barnacles,
tartar sauce, fish paste--
-哦，愚蠢的藤壶，
塔塔酱、鱼酱——

02:48.000 --> 02:50.000
- [wailing]
- [哀号]

02:52.103 --> 02:53.275
- [yelling]
- [大喊]

02:53.344 --> 02:54.862
[crash]
[碰撞]

02:54.931 --> 02:56.172
- [cackling]
- [咯咯笑]

02:56.241 --> 02:57.896
Enjoy your ride, Plankton?
享受你的旅程吗，浮游生物？

02:57.965 --> 03:01.551
- Ow.
- Oh, sorry, Mr. Squidward.
- 噢。
- 哦，对不起，章鱼哥先生。

03:01.620 --> 03:03.689
Didn't see you there.
在那儿没看到你。

03:04.965 --> 03:06.689
- Oh what's Plankton
doing here, Mr. Krabs?
- 哦，什么是浮游生物
蟹老板，在这里做什么？

03:06.758 --> 03:09.103
I thought he was
going to prison.
我以为他是
去监狱。

03:09.172 --> 03:10.379
- He is.
- 他是。

03:10.448 --> 03:12.931
The Krusty
Krab is a prison now.
库斯蒂酒店
克拉布现在是一座监狱。

03:13.000 --> 03:14.137
[laughs]
[笑]

03:14.206 --> 03:17.655
- Oh, hooray!
Prison!
- 哦，万岁！
监狱！

03:18.103 --> 03:19.896
- [inhales weakly]
- [微弱地吸气]

03:20.586 --> 03:24.310
Oh, big deal. I've been
a prisoner here for years.
哦，有什么大不了的。我去过
被囚禁在这里多年。

03:24.379 --> 03:26.517
- Hardy-har, Mr. Squidward.
- 哈代哈尔，章鱼哥先生。

03:26.586 --> 03:28.241
You boys get back to work!
你们孩子们回去工作吧！

03:28.310 --> 03:31.344
I'll be guarding Plankton
in me office.
我会守护浮游生物
在我的办公室。

03:32.517 --> 03:35.413
Into your cell,
you miscreant!
进入你的牢房，
你这个恶棍！

03:42.103 --> 03:44.620
- All right, I'm out of here.
- 好吧，我要离开这里了。

03:44.689 --> 03:47.275
Uh, pardon me, warden, sir,
呃，请原谅，典狱长，先生，

03:47.344 --> 03:50.310
but is that a pretty penny
on the floor?
但这是一个漂亮的便士吗
在地板上？

03:51.172 --> 03:52.413
- Where?
It's mine.
- 在哪里？
这是我的。

03:52.482 --> 03:54.655
It's mine.
I saw it first!
这是我的。
我先看到的！

03:56.413 --> 03:58.758
- The perfect escape.
- 完美的逃脱。

03:58.827 --> 04:00.103
[metal clanks]
[金属叮当声]

04:00.172 --> 04:02.413
[screams]
[尖叫声]

04:05.034 --> 04:06.758
- Oh, no you don't.
- 哦，不，你不知道。

04:06.827 --> 04:09.448
[inhales]
[blowing]
[吸气]
[吹]

04:09.517 --> 04:11.448
Trying to escape
is bad enough.
试图逃跑
已经够糟糕了。

04:11.517 --> 04:14.137
But lying about a penny?
但为了一分钱而撒谎？

04:14.206 --> 04:15.379
You're going in
你要进去

04:15.448 --> 04:17.482
the hole.
洞。

04:18.551 --> 04:20.655
Need one of your holes, boy-o.
需要你的一个洞，小伙子。

04:21.275 --> 04:23.379
- You got it, Warden Krabs.
- 你明白了，蟹老板。

04:23.448 --> 04:26.344
- Hey, let's not do anything
we can't--
- 嘿，我们什么都不要做
我们不能——

04:26.413 --> 04:29.551
[screams]
[尖叫声]

04:33.206 --> 04:35.241
- And don't let him go nowhere.
- 别让他无处可去。

04:35.310 --> 04:36.655
- Aye aye, sir!
- 是啊是啊，先生！

04:36.724 --> 04:38.724
- All right, who turned off
the lights?
- 好吧，谁关掉了
灯？

04:38.793 --> 04:40.379
[groaning]
[呻吟]

04:41.758 --> 04:44.655
- Sorry, sir.
Plankton tickles inside of me.
- 对不起，先生。
浮游生物在我体内发痒。

04:44.724 --> 04:46.068
- That ought to learn him.
- 这应该向他学习。

04:46.137 --> 04:47.448
- Morning, Warden.
- 早上好，典狱长。

04:47.517 --> 04:50.103
- Oh, me favorite
paying police lady.
- 哦，我的最爱
付钱的警察女士。

04:50.172 --> 04:51.827
Here to give me more money?
来给我更多的钱吗？

04:51.896 --> 04:54.965
- Yup, more money
for more prisoners.
- 是的，更多的钱
为了更多的囚犯。

04:55.034 --> 04:58.482
- More prisoners?
- 更多囚犯？

04:59.655 --> 05:02.931
- Aye, the Krusty Krab.
I used to eat here.
- 是的，蟹堡王。
我以前在这里吃饭。

05:03.000 --> 05:07.068
- What a coincidence.
I used to rob here.
- 真是巧合啊。
我以前在这里抢劫过。

05:07.137 --> 05:09.206
- [grumbling]
- [抱怨]

05:09.275 --> 05:11.620
- So what do you say,
Mr. Krabs?
- 那你说什么，
蟹老板？

05:13.206 --> 05:16.000
- I say lock 'em up!
- 我说把他们锁起来！

05:18.000 --> 05:19.172
Spongebob!
海绵宝宝！

05:19.241 --> 05:21.827
Try to prison-up the place
for our new guests.
尝试把这个地方囚禁起来
为我们的新客人。

05:21.896 --> 05:25.103
I gotta go incarcerate
all this cash.
我得去坐牢
所有这些现金。

05:25.172 --> 05:27.965
- I'll do my best,
Warden Krabs, sir.
- 我会尽力，
克拉布斯典狱长，先生。

05:31.482 --> 05:33.931
[vocalizing]
[发声]

05:34.000 --> 05:35.758
- [whistles]
- [口哨]

05:35.827 --> 05:39.137
Nice work, boy-o.
Very prison-y.
干得好，小伙子。
非常监狱。

05:39.206 --> 05:42.827
- Hey, uh, what's with
all the caged men in here?
- 嘿，呃，怎么了
这里所有的笼子里的人都在吗？

05:43.896 --> 05:45.689
They're making me
a little nervous.
他们让我
有点紧张。

05:45.758 --> 05:49.758
- Ooh, um, well, we're
a prison-themed restaurant now.
- 哦，嗯，好吧，我们
现在是一家监狱主题餐厅。

05:49.827 --> 05:52.448
Do your time with
our new prison patty.
花时间与
我们的新监狱小馅饼。

05:52.517 --> 05:54.586
It's served in a solitary
confinement box,
它是在一个单独的地方供应的
禁闭箱、

05:54.655 --> 05:55.931
has its own prisoner number,
有自己的囚犯编号，

05:56.000 --> 05:58.689
and even comes with
toy shackles!
甚至还带有
玩具镣铐！

05:58.758 --> 06:01.103
- Wow!
- 哇！

06:01.172 --> 06:02.241
- Looks delicious.
- 看起来很好吃。

06:02.310 --> 06:03.241
- That's right.
- 这是正确的。

06:03.310 --> 06:04.620
At the Krusty Krab,
在蟹堡王店里，

06:04.689 --> 06:05.758
you can lock up your hunger
你可以锁住你的饥饿感

06:05.827 --> 06:07.241
and throw away the keys!
并扔掉钥匙！

06:07.310 --> 06:10.137
[happy chattering]
Uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh.
[开心的闲聊]
嗯嗯嗯嗯。

06:10.206 --> 06:12.068
Ooh, crisis averted.
哦，危机解除了。

06:12.137 --> 06:15.482
Okay, time to let Plankton
out of the hole.
好吧，是时候让浮游生物
从洞里出来。

06:15.551 --> 06:18.275
Open her up, boy-o.
打开她，男孩。

06:18.344 --> 06:20.724
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

06:20.793 --> 06:22.103
- Hmm.
- 唔。

06:23.517 --> 06:27.758
- [jibbering]
- [胡言乱语]

06:31.034 --> 06:34.137
- Pull yourself together,
prisoner.
- 振作起来，
囚犯。

06:34.206 --> 06:36.724
I got a new cell for you.
我给你准备了一个新手机。

06:43.448 --> 06:46.448
- The formula.
It's so close.
- 公式。
太近了。

06:46.517 --> 06:48.896
I can almost touch it.
我几乎可以触摸它。

06:48.965 --> 06:51.862
No, no, no, no!
不，不，不，不！

06:51.931 --> 06:54.689
- Good times.
Good times.
- 美好时光。
美好时光。

06:56.689 --> 06:59.862
[funky suspense music]
[时髦悬疑音乐]

06:59.931 --> 07:03.344
- Okay, mail call, boys.
Let's see, who do we have?
- 好吧，邮件电话，孩子们。
让我们看看，我们有谁？

07:03.413 --> 07:05.310
Toothy.
露齿的。

07:06.413 --> 07:07.758
Four Eyes.
四眼。

07:09.620 --> 07:11.103
Lefty.
左撇子。

07:12.931 --> 07:14.275
Fats.
脂肪。

07:14.344 --> 07:15.965
Fingers. Einstein.
手指。爱因斯坦.

07:16.034 --> 07:18.689
Stretch, Chuckles, Bingo,
Blammy, Wheels, Boogie, Red,
伸展、轻笑、宾果游戏、
Blammy、车轮、布吉、红色、

07:18.758 --> 07:20.275
Trip, Winks, Skeeter, Stinky.
特里普、眨眼、斯基特、臭臭。

07:20.344 --> 07:22.724
all: Thanks, Spongebob.
全体：谢谢，海绵宝宝。

07:22.793 --> 07:25.068
- No problem, guys.
- 没问题，伙计们。

07:27.275 --> 07:29.551
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

07:30.000 --> 07:31.517
[groaning]
[呻吟]

07:31.586 --> 07:34.379
[wailing]
[哀号]

07:34.448 --> 07:37.275
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

07:37.344 --> 07:39.000
- Oh, morning, officer.
- 哦，早上好，警官。

07:39.068 --> 07:41.965
- I'm here to oversee
Plankton's release.
- 我是来监督的
浮游生物的释放。

07:42.034 --> 07:44.241
His sentence is up.
- What?
他的刑期已满。
- 什么？

07:44.310 --> 07:47.275
But I have so many more
punishments for him.
但我还有很多
对他的惩罚。

07:47.344 --> 07:48.896
- [laughing]
- [笑]

07:48.965 --> 07:52.793
Enjoy your Plankton-free
prison, Eugene.
享受无浮游生物的乐趣
监狱，尤金。

07:54.034 --> 07:57.137
I hope it's worth what
you're paying for it.
我希望它值得
你正在为此付出代价。

07:57.206 --> 07:59.379
[cackling]
[咯咯笑]

07:59.448 --> 08:01.379
- Hmm?
Paying for it?
- 唔？
付钱吗？

08:01.448 --> 08:03.551
Wonder what he means by that.
想知道他这是什么意思。

08:03.620 --> 08:04.551
Huh?
啊？

08:04.620 --> 08:07.551
[elegant music]
【优雅的音乐】

08:07.620 --> 08:10.068
- [yawns]
- [哈欠]

08:10.137 --> 08:11.620
[snoring]
[打鼾]

08:11.689 --> 08:15.206
- [wails]
- [哀号]

08:24.413 --> 08:27.034
- [laughing softly]
- [轻笑]

08:27.103 --> 08:30.965
- More marshmallows
for your hot cocoa, Wobbles?
- 更多棉花糖
沃伯斯，要喝热可可吗？

08:32.482 --> 08:35.000
[cash register dings]
[收银机叮叮声]

08:35.068 --> 08:39.172
- Spongebob,
what are you doing?
- 海绵宝宝，
你在做什么？

08:42.275 --> 08:45.172
- Do you have any idea
how much it costs
- 你有什么想法吗
费用是多少

08:45.241 --> 08:47.000
to make a prison humane?
让监狱变得人性化？

08:47.068 --> 08:51.586
These down comforters,
they're two-ply.
这些羽绒被，
它们是两层的。

08:51.655 --> 08:53.448
- [shuddering]
- [颤抖]

08:53.517 --> 08:57.413
- This ain't no luxury hotel.
- 这不是豪华酒店。

08:57.482 --> 08:59.758
These televisions ain't free!
这些电视不是免费的！

08:59.827 --> 09:03.310
And neither are
these massage chairs.
两者都不是
这些按摩椅。

09:03.379 --> 09:06.448
- [crying]
- [哭泣]

09:07.275 --> 09:11.241
- And this, your
most expensive mistake of all!
- 还有这个，你的
最昂贵的错误！

09:16.517 --> 09:19.965
From now on,
no more patties for prisoners.
从现在开始，
不再给囚犯吃肉饼了。

09:20.034 --> 09:21.586
[prisoners clamoring]
[囚犯叫喊]

09:21.655 --> 09:23.896
- Cruel and unusual punishment!
- 残酷且不寻常的惩罚！

09:23.965 --> 09:26.758
- And no more tomatoes either!
- 也不再有西红柿了！

09:26.827 --> 09:28.931
[indistinct shouting]
[隐隐约约的喊叫]

09:29.000 --> 09:31.758
- Come on, let's find
another prison to eat at.
- 来吧，我们来寻找
另一个监狱吃饭。

09:31.827 --> 09:34.034
- What a rip-off!
- Come on.
- 真是敲竹杠啊！
- 快点。

09:34.103 --> 09:35.827
- No, no!
Come back! Come back!
- 不，不！
回来！回来！

09:35.896 --> 09:39.724
I can't afford to lose
me paying customers.
我输不起
我付费客户。

09:39.793 --> 09:42.482
Oh, I'm ruined!
哦，我毁了！

09:42.551 --> 09:45.586
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

09:45.655 --> 09:47.482
All right, that's it.
好吧，就是这样。

09:47.551 --> 09:49.862
[happy chattering]
[开心的闲聊]

09:49.931 --> 09:51.931
No more prison.
Everyone out.
不再有监狱了。
大家都出去吧。

09:52.862 --> 09:55.724
Don't care where you go,
but you can't stay here.
不在乎你去哪里
但你不能留在这里。

09:56.793 --> 09:58.310
Oh, finally.
哦，终于。

09:58.379 --> 10:01.000
The Krusty Krab is back
to being a regular old
蟹堡王回来了
成为一个普通的老人

10:01.068 --> 10:03.689
money-making restaurant.
赚钱的餐厅。

10:03.758 --> 10:05.827
Problem solved.
问题解决了。

10:05.896 --> 10:07.862
I said problem solved!
我说问题解决了！

10:08.896 --> 10:11.000
- Later that night.
- 那天晚上晚些时候。

10:12.793 --> 10:14.620
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

10:14.689 --> 10:17.310
[startles]
[screams]
[吃惊]
[尖叫声]

10:17.379 --> 10:19.034
[all giggling]
[大家咯咯地笑]

10:19.103 --> 10:22.655
[light clicks]
- Oh, it's just my prison pals.
[轻击]
- 哦，那只是我的狱友们。

10:22.724 --> 10:24.137
What are you guys doing here?
你们在这儿做什么？

10:24.206 --> 10:26.862
- We want to go back
to the Krusty Krab.
-我们想回去
到蟹堡王。

10:26.931 --> 10:29.206
We were having fun
in there with you.
我们玩得很开心
和你在一起。

10:29.275 --> 10:30.586
See?
看？

10:30.655 --> 10:32.103
[prisoners exclaiming]
[囚犯惊呼]

10:32.172 --> 10:33.482
- Aww.
- 哇。

10:33.551 --> 10:34.655
Okay, I'm in.
好的，我进来了。

10:34.724 --> 10:37.931
Time for a jail-break-in.
是时候越狱了。

10:38.000 --> 10:39.689
- The next day.
- 第二天。

10:39.758 --> 10:43.655
- [whistling]
- [吹口哨]

10:43.724 --> 10:46.413
all: Morning, Warden Krabs.
全体：早上好，蟹老板。

10:46.482 --> 10:48.793
- Morning, prisoners.
- 早上好，囚犯们。

10:49.448 --> 10:51.551
[laughter]
[笑声]

10:51.620 --> 10:53.827
Spongebob!
海绵宝宝！

10:53.896 --> 10:55.620
What is going on here?
这是怎么回事？

10:55.689 --> 10:57.724
I set all these criminals free
last night.
我释放了所有这些罪犯
昨晚。

10:57.793 --> 11:00.379
What are they doing
back in their cells?
他们在做什么
回到他们的牢房里？

11:00.448 --> 11:02.551
- Uh, Mr. Krabs, now's probably
not the best time to--
- 呃，蟹老板，现在可能是
这不是最好的时机——

11:02.620 --> 11:05.620
- You know it's a crime to
release prisoners early,
- 你知道这是犯罪行为
尽早释放囚犯，

11:05.689 --> 11:08.034
don't ya?
不是吗？

11:08.103 --> 11:10.413
You're going to prison,
你要进监狱了

11:10.482 --> 11:11.586
criminal.
刑事。

11:11.655 --> 11:12.620
- What?
- 什么？

11:12.689 --> 11:14.758
Oh, well, that's not so bad.
哦，好吧，那还不错。

11:14.827 --> 11:18.448
Pencil me in
for a 3:30 massage, Spongebob.
把我画进去
3:30 按摩，海绵宝宝。

11:18.517 --> 11:20.413
- Oh, you're not staying here.
- 哦，你不住在这里。

11:20.482 --> 11:22.068
The Krusty Krab is full.
蟹堡王已经吃饱了。

11:22.137 --> 11:25.172
We got a new prison
just for you.
我们有了新监狱
只为你。

11:25.241 --> 11:28.931
- Oh, no.
Let me guess.
- 哦，不。
让我猜一下。

11:30.482 --> 11:31.482
[groaning]
[呻吟]

11:31.551 --> 11:33.448
- Mealtime, prisoner!
- 吃饭时间了，囚犯！

11:33.517 --> 11:34.758
[cackling]
[咯咯笑]

11:36.931 --> 11:40.482
- [crying]
- [哭泣]

11:40.551 --> 11:41.793
- Right in the mouth.
- 就在嘴里。

- 就在嘴里。